\f0\b \cf0 \strokec2 1.2 Problem Statement\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Many APIs expose sensitive customer information without implementing sufficient security controls.\
Weak authentication mechanisms, inadequate authorization and poor monitoring can result in unauthorized access, data breaches and financial loss.\
The challenge addressed by this project is developing a secure REST API capable of protecting a large customer dataset while resisting common attacks such as unauthorized access, brute-force login attempts and privilege escalation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
